=============================================================
Quality Checks
=============================================================
Script Purpose:
  This script performs various quality checks dor data consistency, accuracy, and standardization across the 'silver' schemas. It includes checks for:
  - Null or duplicate primary keys.
  - Unwanted spaces in string fields.
  - Data standardization and consistency.
  - Invalid date ranges and orders.
  - Data consisency between related fields.

Usage Notes: 
  - Run these checks after data loading Silver Layer.
  - Investigate and resolve any discrepancies found during the checks.

=============================================================
-- CHecking 'silver.cust_info'
=============================================================
-- Check for NULLS or Duplicates in Primary Key
-- Expectation: No results
SELECT
  cst_id,
  COUNT(*)
FROM silver.cust_info
GROUP BY cst_id
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1 OR cst_id IS NULL;
